# Fingerprint of data/quran.db, enforced by DatabaseFingerprintTest.
#
# Installs cache the extracted database under QuranDatabase.DB_FILE_NAME, so a
# database whose content changed without a version bump is silently ignored by
# everyone who already has the app (see 1e1128df, which shipped exactly that).
#
# Regenerated the database? Change BOTH lines below:
#   1. bump `version` and QuranDatabase.DB_FILE_NAME together (quran-vN -> vN+1)
#   2. record the new digest: sha256sum data/quran.db
version=quran-v55.db
sha256=03670e099cdee60ad78c71300943c58aef889a09acdf97228b872d95b4333fd7
